ReadJSONLines returns nil on err == io.EOF and wraps everything else with
"records: json: %w". Expected: json's concrete *SyntaxError / *InvalidUnmarshalError,
opaque fmt.Errorf origins and Unresolved entries (decoder fields, reader r is
caller-supplied / *strings.Reader), all under the fmt.Errorf link. A sentinel io.EOF
must NOT be in the set (io.ErrUnexpectedEOF may be).
